description:
Mumbai City Carewell Security and Utility Services was established in 2012. MCCS concentrates on the state of Maharashtra and will soon spread to other Indian states. Our major focus is to make everyone feel safe with variety of our services.
The organization is entirely in compliance with the 'PASARA' license and all other Maharashtra norms and regulations. MCCS believes that our employees are our most valuable assets, and we ensure our clients peace of mind by offering the best services available. Mr. Madhukar Balaji Nagare is the proprietor of MCCS and has over 30 years of expertise in the field. MCCS provides various services such as;
Traffic Wardens, Security Guards, Bouncers, Body Guards, Commercial Housekeeping etc
